    "body": "When the RACI updates acknowledged by the team definition changes mid-window, the report divides the period at that date. A RACI updates acknowledged by the team record with an unclear timestamp is reported as uncertain rather than silently imputed. The RACI updates acknowledged by the team report keeps the prior procedure available for comparison. Small RACI updates acknowledged by the team strata are described, not ranked as if the difference were reliable. Review pass 7.1: the account team files the RACI updates acknowledged by the team evidence.\n\nA RACI updates acknowledged by the team exception that repeats becomes a reason code so the queue can show the pattern without retelling it. The RACI updates acknowledged by the team review names the records it could not retrieve and the effect on the denominator. The RACI updates acknowledged by the team review cannot see work that never reached the account plan, and the report states that limit. Review pass 7.2: the account team files the RACI updates acknowledged by the team evidence."
